## Constraints For Workload Generation

- Target architecture is ARM64 (`linux/arm64`).
- Prefer conservative resource defaults suitable for Raspberry Pi.
- Use PVCs for persistent data; avoid SD-card local paths.
- `local-storage` is node-affine (pod pinning risk).
